Command: `<%= wrapper_path %> exec <%= task.class_name %> "<ARGUMENTS>"`

<% if task.required.empty? && task.optional.empty? -%>
No parameters.
<% else -%>
<% task.required.each do |param| -%>
- `<%= param[:name] %>` (<%= param[:type] %>, required)
<% end -%>
<% task.optional.each do |param| -%>
- `<%= param[:name] %>` (<%= param[:type] %>, optional<%= param[:default].nil? ? "" : ", default: #{param[:default].inspect}" %>)
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

<% end -%>
